{"id": "t022-001", "text": "Had coffee with Marcus. He's gone fully vegan since the summer and is really missing cheese. He supports Leeds and is going to the away game at Hull next Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "missing cheese", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Leeds", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away game at Hull", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-002", "text": "Hemi rang. Her cat Biscuit has to have two teeth out on Thursday and she's quite worried about the anaesthetic. Remind me to text her Thursday evening to see how he got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "have two teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
