{"id": "t022-006", "text": "Lunch with Anders and his wife Ines. They're moving to Gothenburg sometime in the spring, probably April. Ines is a bit anxious about finding work there, she's a midwife and her Swedish is still basic. Anders has already lined up a job with an engineering firm and starts on 1 May 2027. They're having a leaving do sometime in March. Anders asked for recommendations for Swedish crime novels, he's working his way through all of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Gothenburg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job with an engineering firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 May 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Swedish crime novels", "owner": "p1"}]}
