{"id": "t022-023", "text": "Valentina, or Val as she likes to be called now, only drinks oat milk flat whites. Very particular about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Val", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks oat milk flat whites", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t022-024", "text": "Francesca's daughter starts nursery after half term. Fran is dreading the drop-offs, says her little one cries whenever she leaves the room. I should text her that first morning to see how it went, and maybe take her for a coffee afterwards. She also mentioned she's given up on her running club for now, which is a shame because she loved it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fran", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the drop-offs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that first morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}]}
