{"id": "t022-031", "text": "Ethan has a job interview with the council on Monday 9 November 2026. He's not that bothered, says it's just practice. Ask him how it went afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview with the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday 9 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not that bothered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-032", "text": "Long catch-up with Nora over dinner. She's had a rough few months. Her dad was diagnosed with Parkinson's in the summer and she's been going up to Durham most weekends to help her mum. She's thinking about going part time at work after Christmas so she can be there more. She also mentioned she's taken up crochet to stay sane, which I love. I should call her sometime next week and maybe send her a nice crochet pattern book.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough few months", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "diagnosed with Parkinson's", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crochet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a nice crochet pattern book", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t022-033", "text": "Anders is a massive Liverpool fan, watches every match even at 5am when he's travelling.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Liverpool", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5am"}]}
{"id": "t022-034", "text": "Pieter said his wife Rin is expecting their second, due in the spring. They haven't picked names yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting their second", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-035", "text": "Ifeoma's not drinking caffeine anymore, migraines. Get decaf in before she visits on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not drinking caffeine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "migraines", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get decaf in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visits", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-036", "text": "Uma's band is playing a battle of the bands on 14 November 2026. She's the drummer and she's been practising every night. She's really nervous. Don't forget to message her good luck on the day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "battle of the bands", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-037", "text": "Just had a nice chat at the school gate. Nothing much.", "spans": []}
{"id": "t022-038", "text": "Lindiwe's son Archie got into the county under-14 cricket squad. Lindiwe is thrilled. Archie bowls leg spin, apparently quite well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county under-14 cricket squad", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "leg spin", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t022-039", "text": "Remind me to book a table somewhere vegetarian for Aneesh's leaving drinks. It's sometime in early December, date TBC.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book a table somewhere vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-040", "text": "Sadia is learning Japanese for a trip to Tokyo next autumn. She practises on Duolingo every day and is up to a 200 day streak. Her husband Tunde is less keen, he's mostly excited about the food and has a list of ramen shops already. They're going for three weeks, possibly in October 2027 if work allows. Sadia's also really into Studio Ghibli and wants to visit the museum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Japanese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Tokyo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "less keen", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly excited about the food", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ramen shops", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "possibly in October 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to visit the museum", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-041", "text": "Coffee with Pooja and Ines. Pooja's started a sourdough obsession, she's named her starter Gerald. Ines is training for her first triathlon in June 2027 and is a bit overwhelmed by the swimming part.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first triathlon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit overwhelmed", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t022-042", "text": "Arturo's mum's 70th birthday is next Sunday. He's organising a surprise lunch for her at the Italian place on the high street and is stressed about it, mostly because his sister keeps changing the guest list. His mum is diabetic so the dessert needs some thought. Must offer to help with the cake, and I should ring him on Saturday to see if he needs anything else.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help with the cake", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t022-043", "text": "Jen says the work Christmas party has been called off this year. Budget cuts. Instead a few of us are doing drinks at hers on Friday 18 December. Jen only drinks gin and has strong opinions about tonic, so I'll bring a nice bottle. Her partner Arturo is cooking, he's doing a Mexican spread because Jen can't stand anything too creamy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drinks at hers", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday 18 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks gin", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arturo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand anything too creamy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t022-044", "text": "Haruto Sato supports the Yokohama Marinos and gets up at stupid o'clock to stream their games. Also loves anything with yuzu.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto Sato", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Yokohama Marinos", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "stupid o'clock"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "yuzu", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t022-045", "text": "Ben was asking about good fly fishing spots in the Lakes. He's going up there sometime next month with his dad, who's just retired after thirty years on the railways. Ben ties his own flies and has a whole tackle box of them. His dad apparently only eats fish he's caught himself, which made me laugh. Worth sending him that list of rivers Archie gave me.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up there", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retired", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ties his own flies", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats fish he's caught himself", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sending him that list of rivers Archie gave me", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t022-046", "text": "Isabel's dog Pickle has gone missing. She's put posters up everywhere. Remind me to message her tomorrow to see if there's any news.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gone missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-047", "text": "Aiko is back from Osaka. She said the funeral was lovely but she's exhausted. I'll take her for a quiet lunch on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t022-048", "text": "Tendai's partner Esther is a pastry chef at a hotel in town. She makes the best canelés. Tendai says she wants a proper stand mixer, they still use a hand whisk.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pastry chef at a hotel", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "canelés", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper stand mixer", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-049", "text": "Valentina has a hospital appointment on the 27th about her knee. She's had the injury since playing netball last year. I should ask how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hospital appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t022-050", "text": "Dentist moved to next Tuesday at 10. Need to rearrange the Tuesday call.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "rearrange the Tuesday call", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday"}]}
{"id": "t022-051", "text": "Francesca's brother Marcus is visiting from Melbourne for Christmas. First time back in five years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Melbourne", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-052", "text": "Chioma has a big presentation to the board on Thursday and she's been up every night preparing. She's pretty anxious about it. Text her on Wednesday night to wish her luck, then check how it went on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation to the board", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t022-053", "text": "Ayo's into vinyl, mostly Afrobeat and highlife. He's after an original Fela Kuti pressing, which could be a nice birthday present at some point.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Afrobeat", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "highlife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "after an original Fela Kuti pressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t022-054", "text": "Tunde's not eating red meat at the moment, doctor's orders after his cholesterol test.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not eating red meat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cholesterol test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t022-055", "text": "Esther and Tendai are buying their first house! Completion is sometime in January. Remind me to get them a housewarming plant when they're in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying their first house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a housewarming plant", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're in", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-056", "text": "Marcus mentioned his little girl Rosie is having her 5th birthday party this weekend. Unicorn theme. He's doing all the cake himself, which seems ambitious.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "5th birthday party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-057", "text": "Hemi follows the All Blacks religiously and will be at the Twickenham match on 7 November 2026 with her brother Pieter. They've had the tickets for months. She's making a day of it, brunch beforehand at the place by the station, then the match, then dinner. Pieter is gluten free so she's been ringing around restaurants. She also plays touch rugby on Wednesday evenings, which I didn't know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "All Blacks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Twickenham match", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "touch rugby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evenings"}]}
{"id": "t022-058", "text": "Note to self: start Christmas shopping sometime soon, before it gets silly.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "start Christmas shopping", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before it gets silly", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t022-059", "text": "Ahmed's wife Sadia is starting a pottery course in the new year. He wants to get her a set of decent tools for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t022-060", "text": "Caught up with Ethan, Nora and Rin at the pub quiz. Ethan's band is recording an EP in a fortnight, he plays keys. Nora's sister is getting married next summer in Crete and Nora is the maid of honour, already panicking about the speech. Rin mentioned she's gone dairy free and feels loads better. Remind me to ask Ethan how the recording went, and send Nora some speech tips.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recording an EP", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "keys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dairy free", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "feels loads better", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Ethan how the recording went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Nora some speech tips", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p9", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
